d by the Saudi government. And look, the list goes on and on and on. And you could include Deborah Ramirez and Julie Sweatnick and any number of other people who are constantly bullied. But Melania thinks that she is the worst in terms of that. Maybe she'll consider this video to be bullying. And look, I get it. Nobody wants to attack the First Lady, it looks bad, it makes you look bad, I probably look bad doing it. But we also have to understand that there is a narrative out there that sure Donald Trump is bad and sure his sons are the worst and Jared seems to suck and even Ivanka seems complicit with this, but not Melania. Melania, she's the one that's stuck with them, like she's probably really a good person. Forget the fact that she agreed with Trump on the whole birtherism thing and she defended him when he was accused by literally dozens of women of sexual assault himself. She is still awful amidst all of this new stuff. Please just bear that in mind. She wants to be the voice asking for people to have, you know, concern over bullying and everything, but she is aiding and abetting some of the worst cyberbulliers in the history of the internet right now. And that continues up and until today. The",
